#: price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Set role-based product prices in WooCommerce. Apply global multipliers or "
"fixed per-product prices per role. Upgrade to Pro for rules, quantity "
"discounts, adjustment types, and more."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in rollbaserade produktpriser i WooCommerce. Tillämpa globala "
"multiplikatorer eller fasta priser per produkt för varje roll. Uppgradera "
"till Pro för att få tillgång till regler, mängdrabatter, justeringstyper "
"och mycket mer."

